Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.\NI want more. Anyone more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again, you\Nknow what I mean, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can make my dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it? I\Nreally don't know what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away. The great\Nend of the unknown rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you. Only win out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Party for tomorrow. Go\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going, roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your eyes that\NI want, but your weary ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, and you want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shine like a star to be good, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just that you can't achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Out of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to the reinforcements\Nheaded to the eastern port?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.98,0:02:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They, uh, seem to have run into\Na bit of trouble along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Their bullets and gunpowder\Nhave gone missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.34,0:02:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, all of our other\Nweapons, like swords, axes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and knives and such, are missing as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only assume they\Nwere stolen by someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:03:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's just the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The warships can't sail from the port.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.22,0:03:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they're all stuck to each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,like someone sewed them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't sew iron with thread?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.84,0:03:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab something and cut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.64,0:03:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Our knives are missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.02,0:03:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, the soldiers who collapsed\Nearlier are still paralyzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.78,0:03:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you possibly\Nscrew things up this much?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.52,0:03:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how many criminals\Nwe're dealing with here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't let them get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.66,0:03:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.28,0:03:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried I might be taking\Ntoo much from them today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.26,0:03:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mauji, you're sure this is okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want them to get paralyzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.76,0:03:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They've all been so generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.22,0:03:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We got permission, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.60,0:03:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,From heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please carry on, princess.\NOkay, then I'll keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.02,0:03:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have a whole ton\Nof heavy injuries to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:04:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're in the middle of\Nthis, but we need to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.58,0:04:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll only be a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.64,0:04:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.96,0:04:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the citizens,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.62,0:04:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,we asked these strange occurrences\Nare the work of fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.78,0:04:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,seems to be something they're used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're obviously lying to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.86,0:04:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep looking into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.90,0:04:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That hold against him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.86,0:04:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't be a barrier if it didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not exactly weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We can hold till Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy and Law show up. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the fight start already?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.42,0:04:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like some crackers, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.32,0:04:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just start talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A boy with white lead disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So there was a survivor from Whitetown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He resents everything in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.56,0:05:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels like I'm watching my\Nolder brother when he was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.06,0:05:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He has my sympathy, but there's\Nno cure for white lead disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get involved too much\Nor you'll give yourself away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget what I'm here to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stop my brother at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.36,0:05:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't lay a finger on Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.06,0:05:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost a lot of good Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.18,0:05:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was different when I lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He was special to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.18,0:05:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We met when he was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought of him as my own son.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He was as honest as they came, with\Nan unshakable sense of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.10,0:06:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, he had my absolute trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.66,0:06:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, he did lie to me once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.36,0:06:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a landing unit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Among the dead, there's\Na Don Quixote exec.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,His codename is Corazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.94,0:06:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I've sent a picture of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you confirm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Rosanante, what were you\Ndoing on that island?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.86,0:06:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.86,0:06:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it felt, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but I know he must have\Nhad a reason. There were
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,four things that were\Nlost during that incident
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the barrel's pirate crew the life\Nof poor rozenante the op-op fruit
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and of course the young\Nboy who was with the don
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.46,0:07:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,quixote family then the\None with the white lead
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,disease. Yeah, that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,was me I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.12,0:07:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,thought so so
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,when Rosenante stepped\Naway from his mission
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,for that half of a year before he died it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,was to help you, wasn't\Nit? That's right. He took
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.54,0:07:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,me to countless hospitals but that failed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.30,0:07:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,so he set his sights\Non the op-op fruit and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,when things went south\Nsince he meant so much
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.34,0:07:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,to me i must ask what\Nexactly did he die for
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,my life everything even though\Nwe weren't able to leave together
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.84,0:07:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,like we planned and gave me back\Nmy freedom and my will to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.70,0:08:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm forever in his debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I carried this out, to take\Ndown Doflamingo and avenge his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.72,0:08:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, I wonder if that\Nwas my fate as a D all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And he knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.26,0:08:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,D.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.38,0:08:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The same secret name is Straw Hat, though\NI still don't know what that amounts to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you used to be the fleet admiral,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.78,0:08:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,perhaps you can tell me, what's\Nthe meaning behind that letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.30,0:08:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell you one thing, Rosanante\Ndidn't know any more about Dee than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, that wasn't the\Nreason why he saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't need a reason,\Nhe did it out of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.38,0:08:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.48,0:09:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Another D, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true, they always\Nfollow a checkered fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame I'm not on active duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have locked you in a cell\Nwhere we could have had a nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.82,0:09:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,long chat about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only person I can share all\Nof my fond memories of Rosanante with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How unfortunate that you're a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to honor his memory,\Nyou can do the same as I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.74,0:09:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep him in your heart, always.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.62,0:09:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Live the life that you desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.18,0:09:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,One that makes you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He fought to set you free.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what he would want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.94,0:10:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's exploding!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.72,0:10:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.10,0:10:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's causing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The buildings are lifting\Nstraight into the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.02,0:10:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not going to drop, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like they're all\Ngoing to the port in the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,\Ndo my allies deceive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the work of a god for\Ngiant invisible birds, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.72,0:10:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one person on the island, more\Npossibly in the world, capable of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.02,0:10:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the work of\NNavy Admiral Fuki Dorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.10,0:10:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but since you don't\Nneed all this debris and rubble,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.36,0:10:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I might put it to good use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Those infernal pirates are the ones who\Nmade this mess, so let them feel its weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.22,0:11:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So now, what we're screwed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we fight back?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing's for\Ncertain—we're going to need
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.70,0:11:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,a much bigger barrier\Nor a different strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on—they're shooting cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.68,0:11:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,that in the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.86,0:11:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's no time to be screaming in\Nterror—we gotta go help the go help the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.94,0:11:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how he intends to\Ncapture all the pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can survive that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.52,0:11:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Their escape fell apart so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.12,0:11:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Bastille.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:11:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bastille!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.92,0:12:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes. Hello, Tsuru. My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I was overwhelmed for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.52,0:12:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, still need those reinforcements?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.32,0:12:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.30,0:12:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All units, withdraw!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.18,0:12:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We no longer need\Nreinforcements at the port!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.84,0:12:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate from the east\Nside of the kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Any civilians you see should also\Nbe evacuated to a safe location!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, no place in this kingdom\Nis safe from this. Set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.84,0:12:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all right, then Trafal—we've
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,been waiting for you in Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.70,0:12:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.98,0:12:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We're
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,under the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.98,0:12:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to sail out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.56,0:12:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.44,0:12:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.72,0:12:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,gotta host some ass! ass Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.46,0:12:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Took his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.70,0:13:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move out! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, there's an angry\NFujitora in your way
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.92,0:13:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody's making a run for it now. Just\Ndodge him, be careful. Just dodge him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gambler Man, do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.90,0:13:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got one coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come, Mr. Elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.28,0:13:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.19,0:13:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.42,0:13:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to be running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pick a fight with that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Being in Thunder isn't good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I back down from the Navy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I did that two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm done with that now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if it's a Navy Admiral\Nor one of the Four Emperors!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.18,0:14:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta beat them all someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.48,0:14:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll never be King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.50,0:14:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna punch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.28,0:14:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.80,0:14:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.46,0:14:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here,\Nbut I want to watch this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.64,0:14:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.70,0:14:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we fight him too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.90,0:14:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm gonna stop you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.90,0:14:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kum-Kum!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.38,0:14:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on board with the\Nstuff that Luffy said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:14:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Like calling out all his moves?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:14:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that some kind of\Nweird power play or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.44,0:15:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.56,0:15:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in push!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.98,0:15:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So sorry about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.68,0:15:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Got carried away there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to concern yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.30,0:15:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was no threat to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.30,0:15:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you ready, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to punch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now a kick and a punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now punching really fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A shove!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Headbots!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A big stomp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.00,0:16:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,First he makes me super-heavy,\Nand then he makes me super-light?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.18,0:16:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I get that you're being a badass, but\NI really think you should run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No more running!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.22,0:16:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.26,0:16:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.54,0:16:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,With your strength,\Nthat's reasonable enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.22,0:16:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I do admire your spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna punch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.48,0:16:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But this strategy of yours,\NI find rather confusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.50,0:16:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you announcing\Nall of your attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.58,0:16:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you taking pity on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.48,0:16:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a Navy Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feared as a monster far and wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.06,0:16:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't achieved this level of strength\Nonly to suffer your misguided sympathy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.68,0:17:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you troubled to see a\Nblind man on the battlefield?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.68,0:17:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Does my prowess not speak for itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd hoped to aggravate\Nme, then you've succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You can laugh your way to the\Ngrave while I take your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.14,0:17:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how strong you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,if I attack you and you can't see it\Ncoming, then that's like cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.26,0:17:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean I don't like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you laughing at, you jerk?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kick you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What good is your sympathy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.24,0:17:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your act of mercy will gain you nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.98,0:17:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to punch you a bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.20,0:17:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a man of conviction,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but it seems you're strung along\Nby some whimsical nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes a punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,When a man enters a battle like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter his side, he\Nhas a standing to uphold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.10,0:18:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That leaves no room for pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how sincere your feelings are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They have no place in this struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.18,0:18:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't desire this fight,\Nbut I believe in my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.06,0:18:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And I won't be suffice like you. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.20,0:18:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Gravity Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.36,0:18:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Raging Tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.32,0:18:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there he is, Harrood!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.50,0:19:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.41,0:19:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him to the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.34,0:19:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.74,0:19:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to run away, Mr. Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.98,0:19:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We got this whole operation\Nwe're pulling off here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.56,0:19:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.02,0:19:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh, are we all cramming\Nonto one ship at the port?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that's kind of dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.52,0:19:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.43,0:19:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our destination is further out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.58,0:19:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.48,0:19:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.96,0:19:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.72,0:19:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got like a whole\Nfleet forming a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.58,0:19:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How far out does this go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Over three miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.06,0:19:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The ships that we'll be taking\Nare hidden in the fog ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.32,0:19:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll cross this connecting\Nbridge made by my
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Aunt Maria See a fleet and\Nboard the ships at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.94,0:20:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.85,0:20:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done fighting the\Nold guy yet! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you be reasonable just this once?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I wouldn't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.80,0:20:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.92,0:20:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You can fight next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think I'll simply let\Nyou escape, you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.86,0:20:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether you fight or you flee, it's\Nalready too late for you, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how you must feel\Nright now, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.74,0:20:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I cannot see\Nthe havoc I have wrought,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.90,0:20:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it looms heavily before your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.82,0:20:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A dark sky that suffocates\Nany hope for escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.76,0:21:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment you try to set sail, this\Nrubble will fall like an endless rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.74,0:21:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinking every ship into the abyss below.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.34,0:21:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you must know, even if by\Nsome miracle you do escape me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.10,0:21:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The four emperors will\Nhound your every step.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,By defeating Joker, you've\Nput a target on your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.80,0:21:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life will be a living hell\Nuntil at last they claim your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.54,0:21:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You took pity on me for my blindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But the truth is, this was an\Ninjury that I brought upon myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.46,0:21:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,These eyes were closed\Nby my own actions because
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.20,0:21:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,they saw too many things\Nthat I didn't care for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.58,0:21:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Things that I wished they hadn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.90,0:21:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.50,0:21:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're so intent on making your way\Nto hell, then allow me to guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.12,0:22:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us back Rebecca, Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.12,0:22:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We got to our hill, dammit! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.20,0:22:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.52,0:22:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,His kingdom has made her suffer enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.18,0:22:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you're planning,\Nwe're going to stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.98,0:22:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to say, there\Nare only criminals ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.08,0:22:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find people are making a\Nterrible mistake by coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.42,0:22:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.38,0:22:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't stop me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.68,0:22:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it, Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.90,0:22:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.36,0:22:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of the pirates ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.00,0:22:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They're running to Strahat.\NThere are thousands of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.02,0:22:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.32,0:22:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all that commotion back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.78,0:22:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of Dressrosa, but\Nwhat do you think they want?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.68,0:22:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Better prepare yourself, Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.26,0:23:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.17,0:23:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.12,0:23:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the ship, chase them out to sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.24,0:23:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.62,0:23:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.24,0:23:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.66,0:23:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite their words, I don't\Nsense a hint of animosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.98,0:23:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Give back Rebecca or\Nwe'll give you a wallop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.42,0:23:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.66,0:23:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw Rebecca at the top of the hill!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.06,0:23:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She's safe with Kairos!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,don't worry we know just have fun\Nnobody talks about it but kiros
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.70,0:23:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,is rebecca's father she's probably\Ngoing to live with him from now on
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.64,0:23:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,they used to live together\Nas a family with scarlet
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.80,0:23:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,in that little cottage on\Nthe hill all the adults
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.70,0:24:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,in the kingdom have known\Nthat for 16 years now
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.38,0:24:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,of course we knew the truth\Nabout the fairies too,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.42,0:24:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but we kept the secret to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.76,0:24:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.48,0:24:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, those pirates saved their kingdom,\Nso now it's our turn to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.42,0:24:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stick close to Lucy, Fujitora won't\Nbe able to drop the rubble from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.62,0:24:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.24,0:24:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You better get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.70,0:24:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in real trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.36,0:24:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a fool, Straw\NHat, but an honest one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.32,0:24:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I shouldn't be surprised\Nthat everyone wants to take your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.28,0:24:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of a man are you, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.58,0:25:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the color of your\Nhair, the shape of your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.80,0:25:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What does your smile look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.10,0:25:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.46,0:25:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish I could use these eyes one last time
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.52,0:25:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,to see the face of a man like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.96,0:25:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's filled to\Nthe brim with kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.48,0:25:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what shall I do with this\Nunsightly weapon I've raised?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.10,0:25:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I look like quite the fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.86,0:25:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I am gonna murder you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.48,0:25:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All our work with Doflamingo is screwed,\Nthanks to your meddling, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.88,0:26:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him escape Dressrosa alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.54,0:26:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about King Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.16,0:26:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's back, our business\Nis gonna suffer for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.44,0:26:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll kill the Straw Hat\Nand all his pals too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.42,0:26:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There'll be no one left to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.66,0:26:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, dress rosa\Nwill be our playground.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.00,0:26:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we'll form an alliance—a\Nfleet of pirates united by our hatred!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.08,0:26:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,hatred
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.72,0:26:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No mercy! No escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.12,0:26:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Take his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.78,0:26:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All marines have retreated, but the\Ncitizens are running to the port!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.62,0:26:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is Isho doing down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.80,0:26:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna keep that\Nrubble in the sky all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.16,0:26:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.88,0:26:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, it's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.52,0:26:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that an awesome ship or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.60,0:27:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not even yours, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.84,0:27:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We better get aboard before the\Nsky falls on us or whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.84,0:27:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you my ship later.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.76,0:27:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna flip out! Draw hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.64,0:27:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have four friends who are\Ngiant mercenaries like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.60,0:27:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to reach out to all\Nthe other giant tribes and.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.76,0:27:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,form a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.86,0:27:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll shake the\Nfoundations of this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.70,0:27:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,just like the famous giant pirates did
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.64,0:27:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.55,0:27:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.48,0:27:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That was Master Dorry and Brogy's\Ncrew in their glory days. That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.04,0:27:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be a good rival then.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.46,0:27:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't wait to see\Nyour crew when it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.32,0:27:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I can't wait\Nto see Elbaf someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.58,0:27:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My aunt to Maria fleet is at your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.30,0:27:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Our force is number 56 ships, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.90,0:27:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Should come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.42,0:27:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so? Lofi-land!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.28,0:27:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We just got permission from our chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.60,0:27:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to join up with you. To join up,\NI won't lose to anyone in a boxing ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.24,0:27:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but if I can't take on pirates, I'll\Nnever be a true champion I agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.10,0:27:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're teaming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.36,0:27:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see where the waves take us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.00,0:28:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't forget about us.\NWe've got your back, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.68,0:28:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This idiot is letting me\Non a ship for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.38,0:28:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm helping you out Call me\Ncaptain at least as for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.88,0:28:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have more experience\Nas a pirate So when we team up,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.52,0:28:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure to be the popular one
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.28,0:28:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not asking for help from anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.76,0:28:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys can do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.26,0:28:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.60,0:28:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We kind of hit it off\Nwhile we were all staying
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.90,0:28:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,at the palace and\Ndecided to run with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.16,0:28:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.30,0:28:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We chose the order by drawing straws.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.42,0:28:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,First, the beautiful\Npirates with 75 members.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.04,0:28:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Their captain is Cavendish\Nof the White Oars.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.92,0:28:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, the Bartolomeo Club with 56 members.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.08,0:28:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Their captain is Bartolomeo the Cannibal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.02,0:29:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the Hapasui Army\Na thousand men strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.72,0:29:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Their 13th leader is Don Sai.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.66,0:29:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, the Triple X Gym Fighting\NAlliance with four members.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.86,0:29:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're led by Destruction Cannon Edeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.60,0:29:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we have the Taunta\NCorps with 200 members.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.50,0:29:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Their leader is Leo the Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.34,0:29:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we have the soon-to-be giant\Npirates, five members and growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.58,0:29:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Their captain is Hyrudin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.14,0:29:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Last but not least, Commodore of the\NYontemaria fleet with 4,300 members.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.18,0:29:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The adventuring pioneer, Orlumbus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.86,0:30:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.70,0:30:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.08,0:30:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A force of 5 ,600 total! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.70,0:30:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, exchange cups with\Nthe leaders of each crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.70,0:30:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll drink ritual sake as father and son!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.80,0:30:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, how does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.66,0:30:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In a crew, the boss is the\Nfather and his men are the sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.10,0:30:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As leader of the Straw Hat Pirates, we\Nhumbly ask you to take us under your wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.72,0:30:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So, do you accept?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.86,0:30:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us exchange the vows\Nof father and son with Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.36,0:30:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy as our new boss.\NAnd us as his followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.68,0:30:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta drink it, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.72,0:30:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.54,0:30:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.84,0:30:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.16,0:30:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not into sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.96,0:31:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not for taste. It's a vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.86,0:31:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen, you're gonna be\Nfamous after this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.20,0:31:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning a bunch of bad dudes\Nare gonna wanna try to kill ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.14,0:31:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how strong you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.42,0:31:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody can win against numbers like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.46,0:31:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You need backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.62,0:31:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where we come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.52,0:31:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved us, so we'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.74,0:31:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.20,0:31:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but if I drink this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.16,0:31:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the big captain guy of\Nsome grand fleet, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.50,0:31:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.32,0:31:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,With 5 ,600 followers, you'd be one of\Nthe most impressive pirates on the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.16,0:31:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're gonna be king of the\Npirates eventually, no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.26,0:31:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's a big world, so if you want to\Nconquer it, then you gotta think big.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.92,0:31:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't care. Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.86,0:31:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.18,0:31:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, put this in a beer mug.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.44,0:31:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.74,0:31:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it's not for taste, it's for a vow!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.34,0:32:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.96,0:32:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A massive military force\Ncould be at your command.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.20,0:32:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The men who stand before\Nyou are almighty warriors,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.48,0:32:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and yet we would have been\Nundone without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.60,0:32:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday you'll find yourself\Nin the same situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.82,0:32:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my style!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.36,0:32:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.27,0:32:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that look?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.20,0:32:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, are people getting ready\Nfor a party? Cause I smell food.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.60,0:32:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.54,0:32:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just change the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.90,0:32:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pissing me off, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.76,0:32:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.67,0:32:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you should be grateful that a star like\Nme is willing to fly under your flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.38,0:32:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's force him to drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.98,0:32:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you saved us, but we're\Nstrong enough to kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.96,0:32:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he was the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.66,0:32:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.42,0:32:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.60,0:32:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be the king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.22,0:32:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to be some big shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.38,0:32:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.29,0:32:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Even for him, that's dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.70,0:32:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, that's good stuff. Knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.32,0:32:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You's a cop!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.46,0:33:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.80,0:33:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, me next.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.44,0:33:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I want some too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.18,0:33:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.52,0:33:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm ever in trouble,\NI'll call you guys for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.80,0:33:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know you'll save me, because that's\Nwhat friends do for each other, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.98,0:33:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to be a big shot\Nor have a whole fleet for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.12,0:33:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you're ever in trouble call us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.40,0:33:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to help anytime
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.76,0:33:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have beat\NMingo without you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.48,0:33:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're friends for life
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.36,0:33:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.92,0:33:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It took a second, but I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.02,0:33:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think I understand what it means\Nfor you to be king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.26,0:33:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not about being big, but being free.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.26,0:33:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.80,0:33:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannon fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.08,0:33:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it the Navy? Can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.30,0:33:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.50,0:33:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I sewed their ships together extra tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.34,0:34:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.44,0:34:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Columbus can take care of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.62,0:34:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but we're still busy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.52,0:34:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever it is, take them out. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.46,0:34:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you have Straw Hats on your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.18,0:34:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand them over or pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.58,0:34:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to defy us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.10,0:34:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back on land! It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.34,0:34:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we leave, Fujitora\Nmight attack Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.58,0:34:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Return fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.02,0:34:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.40,0:34:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him sink!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.02,0:34:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the rubble's raining\Ndown on the enemy's ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.90,0:34:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not us!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.76,0:35:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my parting gift, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.64,0:35:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.14,0:35:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.72,0:35:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That song Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.26,0:35:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy wants, it's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.06,0:35:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.74,0:35:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They love him!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.94,0:35:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.54,0:35:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.10,0:35:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do the oath, because we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.10,0:35:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if Straw\NHeart won't drink with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.52,0:35:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He makes a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.12,0:35:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can do what you want, so can we.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.42,0:35:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna talk about freedom?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.54,0:35:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we have it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.40,0:36:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.94,0:36:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.85,0:36:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I'll raise this sake cup and offer\Nup an oath. The long-witted? Huh? An oath?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.98,0:36:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.58,0:36:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll become the proud\Nfollowers of Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.32,0:36:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, in rain or in shine, we\Nshall serve as his sword and his shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.96,0:36:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,To repay our debt to him, the seven of\Nus offer a loyalty of our own accord.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.36,0:36:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As we drink these cups, let us pledge\Nboth our lives and our hearts alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.34,0:37:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say you guys could do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.56,0:37:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess it's official now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.58,0:37:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get this party started already!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.36,0:37:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd never ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.84,0:37:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us feast in honor\Nof the Straw Hat fleet!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.92,0:37:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,5 ,600 strong! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.70,0:37:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How underhanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.50,0:37:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They just do what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.34,0:37:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I like their style.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.72,0:37:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking good, Big Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.74,0:37:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't wait to work with you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.58,0:37:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I did not drink this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.84,0:37:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the cup's empty,\Nbut that's not on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.64,0:37:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.10,0:37:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't bother trying to force your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.54,0:38:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but we can still swear our loyalty\Nto you whether you like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.86,0:38:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That means, when you're in\Ntrouble, we'll come running.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.94,0:38:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have friends who are willing\Nto do that for nothing in return,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.18,0:38:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,you should be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.82,0:38:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All we ask is that you engrave\Nour names and faces on your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.56,0:38:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.18,0:38:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.72,0:38:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the main course!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.52,0:38:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a fighting fish steak!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.12,0:38:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me some of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.28,0:38:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't climb on poop!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.64,0:38:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's unhygienic!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.90,0:38:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you stop crying already?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.10,0:38:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so touched by his\Nwords, I may never stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.86,0:38:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave me to my tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.02,0:38:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo, I think we're all\Nabout to leave the port.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.70,0:38:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you stay and eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.56,0:38:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we'd miss the banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.08,0:38:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We can take the yellow\Ncubs back to Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.66,0:38:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.08,0:38:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we setting sail now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.12,0:38:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, the bosses, time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.52,0:38:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoist the sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.18,0:39:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the rubble raining down.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.70,0:39:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it wipe out Straw Hat and his friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.18,0:39:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's missing all the targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.28,0:39:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.90,0:39:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That day, Dressrosa experienced some\Nvery unusual weather conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.60,0:39:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end, their heavy downpour of\Nrubble gradually gave way to sunny skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.44,0:39:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, I had no right to\Nchase you down in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.68,0:39:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.70,0:39:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I probably shouldn't say\Nthis out loud, you really did clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.10,0:39:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,up the government's mess here in\NDressrosa And for your courage,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.32,0:39:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you have my eternal gratitude
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.92,0:40:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.64,0:40:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, guys, let's raise our cuffs
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.56,0:40:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Our team kicked the Mingo family's ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.32,0:40:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So here's to us! And...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.98,0:40:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,to victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.34,0:40:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.36,0:40:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's party!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.82,0:40:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys were awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.96,0:40:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Froland!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.16,0:40:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Lind, you're the best! Duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.32,0:40:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Rooster!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.56,0:40:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.14,0:40:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.56,0:40:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.18,0:40:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Chew us!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.56,0:41:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like they made it after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.82,0:41:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.86,0:41:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope they'll come visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.20,0:41:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it warm?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.96,0:41:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.90,0:41:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's much better this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.60,0:41:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you crying, Dad? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.10,0:41:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I never cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.28,0:41:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.74,0:41:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.18,0:42:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.46,0:42:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.10,0:42:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Another round?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.24,0:42:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.46,0:42:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.78,0:42:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Press nose for advanced hair features.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.16,0:42:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you've got places to go, but\Nwe'll see you again, right? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.12,0:42:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.64,0:42:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.38,0:42:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Great news!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.92,0:42:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.34,0:42:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,After the hard-fought battle in Dressrosa,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.08,0:42:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,a very unconventional vow\Nwas made over cups of sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.80,0:43:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,By coincidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.20,0:43:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,or by the hand of fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.52,0:43:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,when the pass of seven mighty warriors\Ncrossed, they pledged their loyalty to Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.34,0:43:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Their own adventures will\Nbring them strength and renown,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.54,0:43:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and one day in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.00,0:43:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,they will play a part in a great\Nincident of historic proportions.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.66,0:43:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But for now, at least, that's a\Nstory no one could have anticipated.
